Fig. 1: Overview of the three-stage AutoVeriFix+ framework. Stage 1 establishes a high-level Python golden model and initial
test vectors. Stage 2 generates the initial Verilog RTL and iteratively repairs syntactic and functional errors. Stage 3 employs
