< Shown in Listing 1: Example 1 >
•
[Verification Failure Report]
< Test Case Input: Clock cycle 1: reset=0, in=8''h02 >
< Expected Behavior: out=1>
< Observed Mismatch: out=0>
•
[Trace Feedback] 
