using profile likelihood analysis for each one, with the results presented in Figure 7
[55] (full details can be found in the Supplementary Materials). From this analysis, we
can estimate confidence intervals for the parameter values using the likelihood ratio
statistic [42, 55]. In Figure 7, the horizontal line indicates the 95% confidence interval
about the maximum likelihood estimate for each parameter, and is defined by
