of ideas from distant (close) fields represent more radical (incremental) innovations, and
they are therefore associated with higher (lower) payoffs in terms of expected profits for the
innovating firm.
What is the role of AI for the creation of recombinant innovations? Our model argues that
the use of AI in R&D increases the probability that a recombinatory search between two
ideas at distance d succeeds, since AI makes it easier to get access to, interpret and apply
advanced scientific knowledge that lies outside of the R&D firm’s core expertise:
