return Contract Data for each Strike Price
end function
Step 2 — Initialize Parameters
r ←0.0427,
Nsim ←10 000,
Nsteps ←100,
Type ←Call
Step 3 — Monte Carlo Simulation
function MONTE CARLO METHOD(S0, dt)
for each simulation path do
for t = 1 to Nsteps do
Z ∼N(0, 1); update price via discretized GBM
end for
end for
Payoff ←max(ST −K, 0)
return e−rT × Payoff, Simulated Paths
end function
Step 4 — Evaluate
Compare estimated option price with market price


