NSGA* has been introduced in Cattelani and Fortino (2024). In-
Supplementary Algorithm 9, we provide a rewriting of NSGA* with
the pseudocode style used in this work. Similarly, Supplementary
Algorithm 8 is a rewriting of the interface MultiObjectiveOpti-
