MOSAIC is optimal under different clustering mecha-
nisms.
Instead of partitioning the data pool into domains
separated by geolocation, we cluster the Navtrain data
pool using captions generated for each clip. We use the
Qwen-2.5-VL-32B-Instruct model [2] to generate captions
for all clips in Dpool. We form six clusters that capture dis-
tinct driving and scene contexts using the TF-IDF feature
vectors of the generated captions. The top uni-grams and bi-
grams characterizing each cluster are provided in Table 3.
Figure 5 reports the validation EPDMS as a function
of the data selection budget for all strategies. We also in-
dicate the base performance and the full-training perfor-
mance, corresponding to the model trained by including all
