Moreover, if a general method satisfies ϵ-uniformly stability, then its generalization error
could also be bounded as EG ≤supzj∼{Di} E[f(wT ; zj) −f( ewT ; zj)] ≤ϵ (Hardt et al., 2016;
Zhang et al., 2022).
