4.4 Identification of Unsafe Control Actions  
Based on the identified subtasks, the UCAs are then defined 
for each control task associated with that subtask. Because 
STPA is the worst-case scenario analysis, we assume that if 
a UCA occurs it will subsequently lead to the associated 


hazard. Table 3 details the UCAs that were identified for the 
obstacle avoidance subtask and provide a description of the 
UCA that occurs based on the control action violation and 
the associated hazards. 
